{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2> 15+ 荃灣地道排隊名店坐鎮🥢 </h2>\n<p>今次活動有多間荃灣區嘅老字號同人氣店，包括35年經驗「奶茶王冠軍」李兆成師傅即場沖茶、拉麵台風首推市集限定「魚介豚骨 BAO」，同場仲有低調高手雞蛋仔及悅和醬園聯乘小食，地道味十足！\n</p>\n<h2> 巨型港式美食打卡位👩🏻‍🍳📸 </h2>\n<p>本地人氣文創「貓室」旗下嘅《癲噹》換上全新「小廚神」造型亮相！現場設有多個巨型打卡位，包括厚切西多士、大滿足漢堡包同酥皮蛋撻仔，可愛度滿分，相機一定要「食」先～</p>\n<h2> 跨地夢幻聯乘🥐 </h2>\n<p>唔止本地餐廳，今次活動仲有跨地域合作！台北 Atelier RAW &amp; Siblings 首度聯乘 Circle Bakery 帶嚟限定貓咪曲奇；澳門人氣 Bread Station 更跨海直送「熔岩芝士拉絲麻糬牛角包」，甜品控千其唔好錯過！</p>\n<p>活動詳情：<br/>\n📅日期：10月24-25日、30-31日 及 11月1日（合共5日）<br/>\n📍地點：荃新天地1期花園廣場</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285046667593548_13478144096adcba2309908.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285046667593548_13478144096adcba2309908.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285046879769648_17567052436adcba253979a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285046879769648_17567052436adcba253979a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285047101756197_195589316adcba2758c9d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285047101756197_195589316adcba2758c9d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285047305930086_20077593436adcba2950f05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285047305930086_20077593436adcba2950f05.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De4MKAcDKsy/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:21:31.672345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":496,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:01:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:58:23.901052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:18.265263+00:00","content_hash":"b4447acb440357c7f1218944e3f6f2fc885b6c9a3496bb986a7bd7720adb95fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}